    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d173-a1">

                <pb facs="0252" n="218" sameAs="frus:frus1870/pg218"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Mr. Washburne to Mr.
                        Fish.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Paris,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1870-07-25"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >July</hi> 25, 1870.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Official notice that France, in present war, adheres to the declaration of Paris,
                    as well in regard to United States as other powers, especially Prussian property
                    in American bottoms, respected unless contraband, and American property
                    respected in Prussian bottoms.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WASHBURNE.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
